# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository.
#
# Three test files were CRLF while the other 84 were LF, and the build recipe
# in each header comment uses backslash continuations. A backslash followed by
# CR is not a continuation to bash, so every line of the command ran as a
# separate command -- and tests/run_all.sh reported it as "compile error",
# pointing at the compiler, which was never involved. Two tests were red for a
# long time over a line ending.
#
# run_all.sh now strips CR defensively; this stops the situation arising.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.iso  binary
*.img  binary
*.bin  binary
